# deploy/editor.Dockerfile's own context filter (BuildKit reads
# `<Dockerfile>.dockerignore` instead of the root .dockerignore, which belongs
# to the test harness). The `manifests` stage copies the whole context, so
# anything left in here is hashed on every build.
**/node_modules
.git
.claude
**/.next
**/out
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/test-content
**/test-settings
**/test-remotes
**/test-clones
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/blob-reports
websites/recipe-website/*/content
websites/recipe-website/editor/settings
websites/recipe-website/export
websites/portfolio
websites/resume-builder
packages/cms/demo/test-content
# Not part of the app: editing them should not rerun `next build`.
deploy
scripts
**/docs
CLAUDE.md
